# Riding on the Clouds (jeuno 131): the level cap alone either side of 65 (a GM's setLevelCap), a level 61 Warrior,
# MAX_LEVEL 99: cap 64 and cap 66: no section (Whence Blows the Wind wants cap 60, Shattering Stars cap 70 and level
# 66): MAAT_DIALOG; cap 65: 88 (the vars drawn), finished with option 0 (the vars back to 0).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/88
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=61
levelcap 64
login
trigger Maat                            # cap 64: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
levelcap 66                             # a GM
trigger Maat                            # cap 66: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
levelcap 65                             # a GM
trigger Maat                            # cap 65: the vars drawn; 88
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
